[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Stop Thief!]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:11.67]How did Roy stop the thieves? | 罗伊是怎样拦住小偷的？
[00:16.41]Roy Trenton used to drive a taxi. | 罗伊·特雷顿原是开出租汽车的，
[00:20.62]A short while ago, however, | 然而就在前不久，
[00:23.65]he became a bus driver | 他当了公共汽车驾驶员，
[00:25.93]and he has not regretted it. | 而他并不为此而感到后悔。
[00:29.27]He is finding his new work far more exciting. | 他发觉自己的新工作令人兴奋得多。
[00:34.53]When he was driving | 最近，当他正开车
[00:35.75]along Catford Street recently, | 在卡特福德街上行驶时，
[00:38.95]he saw two thieves rush out of a shop | 看到有两个小偷从一家商店里冲出来，
[00:43.02]and run towards a waiting car. | 奔向等在那里的一辆汽车。
[00:46.37]One of them was carrying a bag full of money. | 其中一个提着一只装满钱的书包。
[00:51.24]Roy acted quickly and drove the bus | 罗伊行动迅速，开着公共汽车
[00:54.46]straight at the thieves. | 直冲向小偷。
[00:57.29]The one with the money got such a fright | 拿钱的那个小偷吓得
[01:00.67]that he dropped the bag. | 把包都扔了。
[01:03.25]As the thieves were trying to get away in their car, | 当那两个小偷企图乘车逃跑时，
[01:07.60]Roy drove his bus into the back of it. | 罗伊驾驶他的公共汽车撞上了那辆车的尾部。
[01:11.89]While the battered car was moving away, | 当那辆被撞坏的车开走后，
[01:15.46]Roy stopped his bus and telephoned the police. | 罗伊停下来，给警察打了电话。
[01:19.33]The thieves' car was badly damaged and easy to recognize. | 小偷的车损坏严重，很容易辨认。
[01:25.05]Shortly afterwards, | 没过多久，
[01:27.27]the police stopped the car and both men were arrested. | 警察就截住了那辆车，两个小偷都被抓住了。
